{"minVersion":"0.4","class":"DepictionTabView","tintColor":"#27BEF5","headerImage":"https://apt.mjh.im/assets/uuhelper/banner.png","tabs":[{"tabname":"详情","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://uu.goforit.si/#helper","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdev","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 频道","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdevchat","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 群组","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"UU 远控快捷键、圆盘滚轮、快捷切屏与视角记忆，支持 App 内独立开关。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"UU 远程键盘、鼠标与画面增强插件，快捷切屏功能已统一合并。\n\n## 功能\n\n- 常用组合快捷键：Shift+Enter、全选、撤销、剪切、复制、粘贴，自动使用 ⌘ 或 Ctrl。\n- 圆盘鼠标滚轮，转动速度控制滚动速度。\n- 工具栏快捷切换显示器，并高亮当前显示器。\n- 记忆各显示器的缩放与位置，切回前台时恢复视角。\n\n## 设置与升级\n\n安装后彻底退出并重开 UU，在“我的 → 设置 → uu 远控增强”开启总开关，再选择需要的功能。首次使用全部关闭，关闭总开关保留子设置。旧切屏插件按包管理器提示替换，之后只需更新 uu 远控增强。\n\n已安装测试包的用户，请在包管理器中手动选择正式版 1.0.2 覆盖安装。\n\n## 兼容\n\niOS 15.0 及以上，UU 4.42.0（193）与 4.43.0（195）；Rootless / RootHide。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true}]},{"tabname":"更新日志","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://uu.goforit.si/#helper","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdev","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 频道","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdevchat","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 群组","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.2","text":"2026-10-25"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"- 新增快捷切屏及功能独立开关，统一管理键盘、滚轮和画面增强。  \n- 适配 UU 远程 4.43.0，恢复快捷键和圆盘滚轮功能。  \n- 优化切屏及切回前台时的画面刷新与位置恢复。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.1","text":"2026-10-24"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"- 修复切回前台后屏幕缩放和定位失效的问题。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.0","text":"2026-10-21"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"首次正式发布：  \n- 新增电脑键盘常用组合键（Shift+Enter、全选、撤销、剪切、复制、粘贴）。  \n- 新增虚拟鼠标圆环滚轮转盘与自适应转速调节。  \n- 新增多显示屏切换与后台恢复时的视角定位记忆修复。"}]}]}
